    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Walmart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Google</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Recommendation System (Amazon / Netflix)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design \"Recommended for you\": shrink a catalogue of millions of items to the best 25 for one person in about 200 ms, using a funnel of retrieval and ranking, a feature store, embeddings with nearest-neighbour search, and a pipeline that mixes offline, nearline and online computation.</p>\n      "
